<title>BELGIUM: BA's Ayling makes no comment ahead of EU meeting.</title>
<headline>BA's Ayling makes no comment ahead of EU meeting.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Airways chief executive Robert Ayling would make no significant comment in answer to reporters' questions on Friday as he arrived for talks on his airline's alliance plans.</p>
<p>Ayling was to meet European competition commissioner Karel Van Miert to seek a breakthrough in discussions about British Airway's planned deal with AMR Corp's American Airlines.</p>
<p>-- Brussels newsroom 32 287 6800</p>
</text>
